# Frontend (Nuxt 3)

## Stack

Nuxt 3 (`type: module`), Pinia, VeeValidate + Yup, VueUse, Tailwind (inline config in `nuxt.config.ts`), TipTap, Lucide, Fuse. Dev server: `127.0.0.1:3000`.

## Must follow

- Authenticated HTTP: `const { api } = useApi()` — never raw `$fetch` with manual Bearer except auth store login/register/refresh.
- Auth: `useAuthStore()` + cookies (`vocko_at` / `vocko_rt` / `vocko_user` / `vocko_rm`). Remember me → persistent cookies (30d); unchecked → session cookies only. Persist only via `writeAuthCookies` (`useCookie` is readonly). Respect `middleware/auth.ts` and `guest.ts`.
- Layout/nav/search: `layouts/default.vue` (global `/search`).
- Prefer `components/Flashcard.vue`, `ConfirmModal.vue`, `RichTextEditor.vue` over new one-offs.
- Sanitize rich HTML via existing `utils/sanitizeRichHtml.ts` / `richText.ts`.

## Pages map

- Decks: `pages/deck/index.vue`, `pages/deck/[id].vue`
- Study: `pages/learning/session.vue`, `history.vue`
- Import: `pages/import/toeic-text.vue`

## Config

- API base from `runtimeConfig.public.apiBase` ← `NUXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE`
- Keep dark slate/emerald look unless redesign is requested

```ts
// ❌ BAD
await $fetch('/decks', { headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}` } })

// ✅ GOOD
const { api } = useApi()
await api('/decks')
```
